      <title>英特尔Nova Lake-S确认LGA1954新插槽 桌面升级必须换主板</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260830/%E8%8B%B1%E7%89%B9%E5%B0%94Nova-Lake-S%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4LGA1954%E6%96%B0%E6%8F%92%E6%A7%BD-%E6%A1%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%BB%E6%9D%BF/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
